S ===\n\nUse the provided images as visual guidance for Riven\nand the burning village environment.\n\nUse the provided final frame from the previous sequence\nto establish the beginning of this scene.\n\nMaintain natural visual continuity.\n\n\n=== TECHNICAL ===\n\n16:9 cinematic live-action dark fantasy.\n\nBurning village at dusk.\n\nGrounded realistic movement.\n\nNatural cinematic camera movement.\n\nDense smoke, drifting ash, embers, and firelight.\n\nMysterious and restrained atmosphere.\n\nNo clear creature reveal.\n\nNo combat sequence.\n\nNo subtitles.\n\nNo background music.\n\n\n=== SCENE ===\n\nBegin directly from Riven standing inside the burning village.\n\nShe has suddenly stopped moving.\n\nHer attention is fixed on something deeper in the smoke ahead.\n\nHold briefly on her uneasy expression.\n\n\nRiven listens.\n\nA faint sound comes from somewhere deeper inside the village.\n\nShe believes it might be her father.\n\n\nRiven quietly calls:\n\n\"Father?\"\n\n\nNo answer.\n\n\nRiven begins moving carefully toward the sound.\n\nShe walks deeper between the damaged buildings.\n\nHer sword remains intact and stays with her.\n\n\nAs Riven searches,\nshe notices strange dark marks\nacross damaged wood and the ground.\n\nThey look different from the ordinary fire damage around them.\n\nRiven looks at them briefly,\nconfused by what she sees.\n\nThen another faint sound comes from farther ahead.\n\n\nRiven immediately continues toward it.\n\n\nSmoke becomes thicker.\n\nVisibility becomes increasingly poor.\n\n\nThrough the smoke ahead,\na vague dark shape briefly moves\nbetween the ruined structures.\n\n\nRiven stops.\n\n\nShe looks toward the movement.\n\n\nFor only a moment,\nsomething resembling a distant dark silhouette\ncan barely be seen through the smoke.\n\n\nDo not clearly reveal what it is.\n\n\nThe shape disappears.\n\n\nRiven looks around,\ntrying to understand where it went.\n\n\nSilence.\n\n\nThen sudden movement comes from outside her field of view.\n\n\nRiven turns toward it—\n\nA powerful unseen impact suddenly hits her.\n\n\nThe source of the impact remains hidden.\n\n\nRiven is knocked violently off balance\nand thrown onto the ground.\n\n\nHer intact sword is knocked from her hand.\n\nThe sword slides across the dirt\nand comes to rest several feet away from her.\n\n\nRiven remains conscious,\nbut stunned and exhausted.\n\n\nEnd with Riven on the ground\nand her intact sword lying beyond her reach.\n\n\nDo not show what attacked her.\n\n\nCUT.", "reply_message_format": "生成された動画：%s"}}}, "chat_history_count": "0", "chat_id": "1506933857775377", "chat_next": "1", "client_report_scene": "gui", "commerce_feature_key": "doubao_create_pe", "cot_switch": "0", "gen_msg_id": "1503836294890257", "image_attachment_num": "3", "inner_app_id": "495671", "inner_bot_id": "7339470689562525703", "inner_cluster": "default", "inner_did": "7688706254563591685", "inner_env": "prod", "inner_flow_app_variant": "doubao", "inner_is_dola_agent_hub": "1", "inner_is_tour": "false", "inner_libra_versions": "72202937,73582984,76233209,76915148,76999789,77046910,77046923,77054263,77064695,77068989,77069090,77088724,77102831,77110987,77111010,77111068,77111152,77111187,71795104,72061060,72168304,76461562,76709907,77202863,76295625,76961156,77019339,77088588", "inner_log_id": "2026092718003088ECDD56F0E090DA897E", "inner_msg_lang_code": "en", "inner_msg_lang_confidence": "0.9959398508071899", "inner_msg_lang_display_code": "en", "inner_msg_lang_exemption": "false", "inner_pc_version": "3.38.0", "inner_platform": "web", "inner_real_app_id": "495671", "inner_region": "VN", "inner_samantha_web": "true", "inner_tea_uuid": "7688706267452900869", "inner_terminal_app_id": "495671", "inner_tt_wid": "7688706254563591685", "inner_ttwid": "7688706254563591685", "inner_user_ip": "123.16.224.226", "inner_version_name": "", "inner_webid": "7688706254563591685", "input_skill": {"skill_id": "17", "skill_type": 17}, "is_general_task": "0", "is_image